{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sustainability Executive","role":"Sustainability Executive","summary":"A Sustainability Executive helps organisations improve their environmental and social performance through sustainability programmes, ESG reporting, resource efficiency, carbon management, waste reduction, environmental compliance, responsible sourcing and stakeholder initiatives.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Sustainability / Environmental Studies"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability / Environmental Studies → Sustainability Executive"},{"type":"p","text":"A Sustainability Executive helps organisations improve their environmental and social performance through sustainability programmes, ESG reporting, resource efficiency, carbon management, waste reduction, environmental compliance, responsible sourcing and stakeholder initiatives."},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strongly aligned entry-level career for B.Sc Sustainability/Environmental Studies. The field is interdisciplinary, so combining environmental knowledge with ESG, carbon accounting, data analysis, reporting and business skills is especially valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Career facts"},{"type":"table","header":["Item","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree"},{"text":"B.Sc Sustainability / Environmental Studies"}],[{"text":"Entry career"},{"text":"Sustainability Executive"}],[{"text":"Career cluster"},{"text":"Sustainability · ESG · Environment · Climate"}],[{"text":"Strongest foundations"},{"text":"Environmental science + sustainability + economics + policy"}],[{"text":"High-value skills"},{"text":"ESG reporting, carbon accounting, LCA, data analysis"}],[{"text":"Digital stack"},{"text":"Excel + Power BI + Python/R + GIS"}],[{"text":"Business skills"},{"text":"Reporting, stakeholder management, project management"}],[{"text":"Long-term route"},{"text":"Sustainability 